[
    {
        "id": "water_pump_comment",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "tab_dashboard",
        "name": "═══════════════ WATER PUMP CONTROL (4 RELAYS) ═══════════════",
        "info": "## Water Pump Control\n\n**Flow Number:** 410\n**Device:** Tasmota 4-relay board (`pompaApa`)\n\n### Relays\n1. **POWER1** - Porneste pompa (Start pump)\n2. **POWER2** - Elimina apa (Drain water) - 10s pulse\n3. **POWER3** - Alimentare sant 1 (Feed trench 1)\n4. **POWER4** - Alimentare sant 2 (Feed trench 2)\n\n### MQTT Topics\n- Status: `stat/pompaApa/POWER1-4`\n- Command: `cmnd/pompaApa/Power1-4`\n\n### Special Features\n- Relay 2 has automatic 10-second pulse (auto-off after 10s)\n- All switches use Dashboard 2.0 (ui-switch)\n- State tracked in global context\n\n### Dependencies\n- ui_group_water_pump (from 400-irrigation-base-config.json)\n- mqtt_broker_local\n- water_pump_state (global context)",
        "x": 290,
        "y": 40,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
        "id": "water_pump_status_1",
        "type": "mqtt in",
        "z": "tab_dashboard",
        "name": "Pump Power Status",
        "topic": "stat/pompaApa/POWER1",
        "qos": "2",
        "datatype": "auto-detect",
        "broker": "mqtt_broker_local",
        "nl": false,
        "rap": true,
        "rh": 0,
        "inputs": 0,
        "x": 170,
        "y": 120,
        "wires": [
            ["water_pump_convert_1", "water_pump_store_1"]
        ]
    },
    {
        "id": "water_pump_store_1",
        "type": "function",
        "z": "tab_dashboard",
        "name": "Store Pump Power State",
        "func": "const state = global.get('water_pump_state') || {};\nstate.pump_power = msg.payload;\nstate.lastUpdate = new Date().toISOString();\nglobal.set('water_pump_state', state);\nreturn null;",
        "outputs": 0,
        "noerr": 0,
        "initialize": "",
        "finalize": "",
        "libs": [],
        "x": 430,
        "y": 80,
        "wires": []
    },
